WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,780
What are you doing on the road? Get in the car?

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:09,200
What are you doing? Are you still leaving?

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,050
What's wrong with the captain?

4
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:16,050
He didn't even get in the car and ran away

5
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:17,050
Shall we chase him?

6
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,050
Let's go. There are many survivors.

7
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:19,050
Waiting for our rescue

8
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,050
I want to go. Let me go.

9
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:27,050
Where should I take my daughter now?

10
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:31,450
What's going on? What am I going to do?

11
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,180
Come out to find Jin He

12
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,180
That's the current team of capable people

13
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,180
Too many people came out to take action.

14
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,180
Gotta avoid them

15
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,180
There are many high-end golden cranes around here.

16
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:42,250
But where should I go to open walnuts?
